{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n安德尊在今晚（16日）播出的TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》中，向車婉婉上演一場極度瘋狂的示愛戲碼！劇中他飾演的谷總不但頻頻派心，更發動「押韻」攻勢瘋狂示愛，嚇得車婉婉當場打冷震，但她竟然「癲埋一份」用押韻還擊，場面極盡搞笑，究竟這場「押韻大戰」有多爆笑？\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情高潮 大王當眾派心心示愛</h2>\n<p>在最新劇情中，谷總（安德尊飾）搬入開心小棧後，竟然在吵鬧的過程中愛上了代為打理小棧的嘉冰（車婉婉飾）。為了表達愛意，谷總選擇在小棧當眾向嘉冰示愛，除了大派心心，更使出瘋狂的「押韻」攻勢，用一句又一句押韻的句子發動情話攻擊。安德尊招牌的浮誇演繹，令整個示愛場面充滿喜感，讓在場眾人目瞪口呆。</p>\n<h2>車婉婉被嚇癲埋一份 絕核表情押韻還擊</h2>\n<p>面對谷總突如其來的押韻示愛，嘉冰被嚇到當場打冷震，表情又驚又無奈。不過，她並未就此罷休，為了反擊，她竟然「癲埋一份」，即場以同樣押韻的句子還擊，與谷總展開一場史無前例的「押韻大戰」！就連坐在一旁「食花生」的侯雋熙，亦忍不住加入戰團，用押韻句子取笑車婉婉，令場面更加混亂爆笑。車婉婉的絕核表情，絕對是今晚不容錯過的亮點。</p>\n<h2>安德尊親解拍攝感受 大讚編劇心思巧妙</h2>\n<p>對於這場充滿創意的對手戲，安德尊在接受官方訪問時也笑不攏嘴，並大讚編劇心思巧妙。他表示：「同婉婉玩押韻嗰場戲都好好笑，拍嗰陣大家都好開心。」從他的回應中，可以感受到拍攝現場的歡樂氣氛。安德尊更笑言為了配合角色，特意出動了多套顏色鮮豔的「私伙」西裝進行拍攝，務求讓角色形象更突出。</p>\n<h2>網民預告捧腹大笑：呢對CP好新鮮</h2>\n<p>這場「押韻大戰」的預告一出，已引來網民熱烈討論，紛紛表示極度期待。有網民留言：「淨係睇預告都笑死，大王同車婉婉玩押韻？太有創意！」不少觀眾都期待看到車婉婉的反應：「好期待車婉婉個樣，一定勁無奈又好笑！」更有網民認為這對新組合充滿火花：「估唔到安德尊同車婉婉可以組CP，感覺好新鮮，想睇佢哋之後點發展！」、「編劇係咪飲多兩杯先寫到呢場戲？Respect！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_12218911246afa824b839df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_12218911246afa824b839df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_15541693216afa82513d7e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_15541693216afa82513d7e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14518812236afa82568e738.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14518812236afa82568e738.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_10927716036afa825c0d969.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_10927716036afa825c0d969.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3459673816afa8265a2cdc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3459673816afa8265a2cdc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5634454376afa826f4a0ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5634454376afa826f4a0ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_2100711206afa8279c5ec9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_2100711206afa8279c5ec9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14768422486afa828051556.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_14768422486afa828051556.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_20538031746afa8285f11cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_20538031746afa8285f11cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.639152+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1136,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:30:11.260293+00:00","content_up